    t:ruleLogic "If (ImprovementType = \"Dwelling\" or (ImprovementType = \"Outbuilding\" and OutbuildingRealPropertyIndicator = \"true\" and AccessoryDwellingUnitIndicator = \"true\")), and UnitBelowGradeUnfinishedAreaMeasure is not provided in a given instance of PROPERTY_UNIT_AREA" ;
